{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统工程","docCount":3,"url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"feature-engineering","title":"时序特征工程","url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/feature-engineering","wordCount":1349,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"pipeline-architecture","title":"预测管道架构","url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/pipeline-architecture","wordCount":1303,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"online-serving","title":"在线预测服务","url":"/h/data-science/time-series-forecasting/systems/online-serving","wordCount":1153,"readingTime":5}],"introMarkdown":"# 系统工程\n\n把模型从 Jupyter Notebook 搬到生产系统是一个完整的工程问题。本章聚焦三个层面：如何从原始时序数据中构建高质量特征（特征工程）、如何设计端到端的预测管道（离线训练 + 在线推理 + 回测验证）、以及如何在严格延迟和可用性约束下提供在线预测服务。\n\n工程视角贯穿全章：数据漂移检测、模型版本管理、A/B 灰度上线、监控告警——这些才是决定预测系统 ROI 的关键因素。\n"}